314 0 obj
<<
/A 961 0 R
/Alt (Infographic summarizing the effects of Tiantian Capsule \(TTC\), a commercial health food product containing botanical/fungal source materials and xylooligosaccharides, on low-fiber diet-induced constipation. The figure integrates fecal microbiota profiling, in vivo rat experiments, ELISA measurements, and RNA-sequencing results. Summary boxes indicate enhanced gastrointestinal motility, restored gut microbiota homeostasis, and proposed pathways involving serotonergic synapse and the intestinal immune network for IgA production. Key molecules, microbial genera, and biological processes are highlighted with directional indicators.)
/K [7 962 0 R]
/P 123 0 R
/Pg 43 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 1)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
